Looking at this PR, let me analyze the logic change carefully.

The original code used `Math.Sin(Math.PI / deltaDifferenceRatio)` where `deltaDifferenceRatio = min/max` (range [0,1]). The new code computes `reverseDeltaDifferenceRatio = max/min` (range [1, ∞)) and takes the fractional part.

Let me check the edge cases in `SmoothstepBellCurve`.

